== System components (not Rust crates) ==

These are provided by the operating system or the user and are not redistributed by
tpt-shell unless the pinned-runtime build option is used (spec §10.8).

- WebView2Loader.dll (Windows, x64 and arm64), from the Microsoft.Web.WebView2 NuGet
  package, version 1.0.4312-prerelease (checked 2026-10-20). Licence: BSD-3-Clause, text
  reproduced below. SHA-256 of the x64 file: 909828eb2922694b156ae367751466722fe148a1b151245bbc8a80a24dc32645. Shipped with the app; this is the
  OfficialLoader strategy (spec §6.1, decision O1). The package's NOTICE.txt also lists
  third-party components bundled in that package; check them before shipping any file
  from it other than the loader.
- Microsoft WebView2 Runtime (Windows). Not redistributed by default. Licence: Microsoft
  Edge WebView2 Runtime EULA. Covers the runtime only when the pinned-runtime option
  (spec §10.8) is used; that path needs a legal review first.
- WebKit / WebKitGTK (Linux). Licence: LGPL-2.1+ and BSD-style, as shipped by the
  distribution. Dynamically loaded with dlopen. Not statically linked.
- GTK 3 / GTK 4 (Linux). Licence: LGPL-2.1+. Dynamically loaded with dlopen.
- WKWebView / AppKit (macOS). Part of the operating system.

